+- AC-034 (FR-021, FR-031): Given an operation cancelled by leaving the page that later completes, when its key is 
replayed, then the status is "discarded" with no draft and no new dispatch; given a key first used more than 24 hours 
ago, then the replay is rejected as expired without dispatch; given the server process is killed after dispatch, then 
10 minutes later the operation is "failed", usage stays counted, and deleting the note does not change usage.
 
