**Section A: Prior-finding status**

| Finding | Status | Reason against SPEC v4 |
|---|---|---|
| R3-1 | Resolved | FR-021 explicitly discards cancelled payloads and returns terminal “discarded” on replay; FR-031 
preserves accounting across deletion. AC-034 covers cancellation/completion. |
| R3-2 | Partially | The 24-hour replay window and 10-minute crash outcome are defined. Expired-key recognition after 
